# Sketch On Face (F1): with nothing selected, Features > Sketch On Face
# says what to select; with the top face of the extrusion of
# path_extrude picked, it starts a sketch whose workplane lies in the
# face, which the group screen names. A rectangle drawn there and
# extruded stands on the block, and Analyze > Check Solid finds the
# whole sound.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
answer ok
menu Features|Sketch On Face
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu Features|Sketch On Face
dump
tw
key r
move 300 250
down L 300 250
up L 300 250
move 400 330
down L 400 330
up L 400 330
key esc
key x shift
dump
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
